  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000qv9l](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000qv9l) Magnitude 5.7 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Jul 26 2025 60km NE of Sorong. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -0.4189 longitude 131.5485. It impacted 14888 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
